  "thig1.18:1.1": "hitvā ghare pabbajitvā ",
  "thig1.18:1.2": "hitvā puttaṃ pasuṃ piyaṃ | ",
  "thig1.18:1.3": "hitvā rāgañ ca dosañ ca ",
  "thig1.18:1.4": "avijjañ ca virājiya | ",
  "thig1.18:1.5": "samūlaṃ taṇham abbuyha ",
  "thig1.18:1.6": "upasanta mhi nibbutā. ",
  "thig1.18:2.1": "Saṅghā. || ekikā theriyo samattā. || ",
